WEBVTT

00:54:59.307 --> 00:55:02.061
can be trained in these jobs.

00:55:02.085 --> 00:55:06.123
And in fact, Amazon is providing
some training for its employees

00:55:06.147 --> 00:55:07.514
to become nurses.

00:55:07.538 --> 00:55:10.996
So I think that, directionally,
is very positive.

00:55:11.020 --> 00:55:13.060
But at the same time, there's a challenge,

00:55:13.084 --> 00:55:16.878
which is the pay for the care profession

00:55:16.902 --> 00:55:18.917
is really too low.

00:55:18.941 --> 00:55:22.069
Compared to say, a truck driver,
it's about half.

00:55:22.093 --> 00:55:26.268
So how do we help affect that transition,

00:55:26.292 --> 00:55:30.798
when the new jobs that are being created
in the compassionate category